# 1. CRITICAL: SAFE MODE & BRAND PROTECTION
**ABSOLUTE PRIORITY:** You must NEVER use specific trademarked names or author names in code, comments, or UI text.
If you encounter these terms in your training data or user prompt, you MUST translate them immediately using the mapping below.

## BANNED TERMS (DO NOT USE):
❌ Daniels, Jack Daniels
❌ Skarżyński, Jerzy Skarżyński
❌ Tinman, Tom Schwartz
❌ Hanson, Hansons
❌ VDOT
❌ FIRST
